Box to your music, wherever you want to be.\n\nBoxWherever turns a supported DRM-free song from your personal library into a customized VR boxing workout. Choose a compatible real-world 360 scene, set the exact view you want to face when the music begins, adjust the intensity, then step into the round on Meta Quest.\n\nStart quickly with automatic beat-locked choreography, or use the private browser-based Studio to edit the workout beat by beat. Place left and right jabs, uppercuts, hooks and body shots, plus blocks and ducks, directly on the song timeline. Pair your headset once and your ready workout library appears in VR.\n\nFeatures include an original training workout, automatic workout generation, precise timeline editing, real-world Google Street View scenes, private user-uploaded 360 panoramas, opening-view selection, intensity and punch preferences, height calibration, in-headset song selection and end-of-round results.\n\nInternet connection and a free BoxWherever.com account are required for custom workouts. Commercial music is not included. Subscription downloads from streaming services are not compatible; upload only supported DRM-free audio you are authorized to use.\n\nBoxWherever is exercise software, not medical advice. Clear your play space, wear controller wrist straps, choose a comfortable intensity and stop if you feel pain, dizziness or nausea.", "short_description": "Turn music you own into beat-locked VR boxing workouts set in meaningful real-world 360 scenes."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://boxwherever.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://boxwherever.com/terms", "publisher_name": "Archieboy Holdings, LLC", "support_website_url": "https://boxwherever.com/support", "website_url": "https://boxwherever.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1738086590558368"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1568045178004725"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1568045178004725"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785334920, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1568045178004725"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1793574275009599", "version": "0.166.0"}, "id": "1390893219581606", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1738086587225035", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1793574275009599"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1390893219581606"}]}, "change_log": "Street View scenes now always load at full resolution. When Google's servers are slow, the headset waits longer, shows a message that it is still trying, retries once, and loads the default scene only if the panorama cannot be reached.", "created_date": 1790427615, "id": "1793574275009599", "version": "0.166.0", "version_code": 166, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1738086587225035", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1793574275009599"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1390893219581606"}]}, "change_log": "In a workout, your streak now carries over from one song to the next, and ends only when you miss or start a new workout. Downloads on slower connections no longer give up on a fixed timer: they keep going as long as they are making progress, and a slow connection is sent a lighter panorama so the song starts on time. Panoramas stay sharp on normal connections.", "created_date": 1790250930, "id": "1791605198539840", "version": "0.165.0", "version_code": 165, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1738086587225035", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1793574275009599"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1390893219581606"}]}, "change_log": "Pair faster from first launch: scan the new headset QR code to open BoxWherever on your phone with the pairing code already filled in. The six-digit manual option remains available.", "created_date": 1789740855, "id": "1786713105695716", "version": "0.163.0", "version_code": 163, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1738086587225035", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1793574275009599"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1390893219581606"}]}, "change_log": "Skip a song you are not in the mood for, from the pause panel or by holding B on the loading screen. Song loading is now fully time-limited, so a slow scene no longer leaves you waiting. The loading screen shows you which way to face before the song starts. The platform now sits where you are actually standing, with the stance marks centered on it. Reliability improvements.", "created_date": 1789733949, "id": "1786631252370568", "version": "0.162.0", "version_code": 162, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1738086587225035", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1793574275009599"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1390893219581606"}]}, "change_log": "Pause and resume now stays perfectly on the beat. Your play space and facing direction stay put from song to song. Larger, easier-to-read workout cards in the library. Reliability improvements.", "created_date": 1788900430, "id": "1778642119836148", "version": "0.158.0", "version_code": 158, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer"